3feebe2369f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c4d09ab5ec22020284f3d81321e16fa, https://si.imgix.net/7c42d7f3/uploads/origins/edcc626a-8efb-4c23-931e-73feebe2369f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2d7abc35460d3ab91d6b3e4f132bd79 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7c42d7f3/uploads/origins/edcc626a-8efb-4c23-931e-73feebe2369f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e82a917070ea84f4dcedcf33571014d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello there, I'm in love with your art. I'd love for you to draw my Vtuber Character in horizontal 16:9. She is a happy, bubbly and cute marshmallow bunny girl. Please draw my character laying on bed in this outfit https://imgur.com/iTEfO3A between many bunny stuffed animal and marshmallow pillows https://imgur.com/LGjC43t. The themes of the bed and wall are light pink and white theme. I will leave the pose and expression up to you. \nI would like separate layers for characters, backgrounds, and signatures. I will also use this on my stream and YouTube with credit to you. \nThank you very much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@syuu51/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/093a89e9/uploads/origins/9531b7d7-af4a-44fa-a1ab-4e143c2289e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38ca07a5f02fc7ee379196236b0e8ca6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/093a89e9/uploads/origins/9531b7d7-af4a-44fa-a1ab-4e143c2289e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38ca07a5f02fc7ee379196236b0e8ca6, https://si.imgix.net/093a89e9/uploads/origins/9531b7d7-af4a-44fa-a1ab-4e143c2289e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9deb52d5f06dd18b449721b8873468fc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/093a89e9/uploads/origins/9531b7d7-af4a-44fa-a1ab-4e143c2289e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=